# CodeSystem.description
#: CodeSystem.description
msgid "oBDS-specific classification systems and scoring systems not yet covered by international terminologies (SNOMED CT, NCI Thesaurus). These codes supplement the existing ValueSet for additional classifications. Research required: Check if SNOMED CT or LOINC codes exist for these scoring systems before using oBDS-specific codes."
